' is defined but never used.","'useSearchParams' is defined but never used.","'idd' is assigned a value but never used.","'discount' is assigned a value but never used.","'setdiscount' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'show2'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","ArrayExpression",["253"],"'Link' is defined but never used.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'show'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["254"],["255"],["256"],"React Hook useEffect contains a call to 'setprice'. Without a list of dependencies, this can lead to an infinite chain of updates. To fix this, pass [d] as a second argument to the useEffect Hook.",["257"],["258"],"'pro' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'show', 'show2', and 'showreview'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["259"],"'saledata' is assigned a value but never used.","'total' is assigned a value but never used.","'settotal' is assigned a value but never used.",["260"],"'teamMembers' is assigned a value but never used.","'faqs' is assigned a value but never used.","'partnerBrands' is assigned a value but never used.","jsx-a11y/iframe-has-title","<iframe> elements must have a unique title property.",["261"],"'e' is defined but never used.",{"desc":"262","fix":"263"},{"desc":"264","fix":"265"},{"desc":"266","fix":"267"},{"desc":"268","fix":"269"},{"desc":"266","fix":"270"},{"desc":"271","fix":"272"},{"desc":"273","fix":"274"},{"desc":"275","fix":"276"},{"desc":"266","fix":"277"},{"desc":"266","fix":"278"},"Add dependencies array: [mail]",{"range":"279","text":"280"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [id, show2]",{"range":"281","text":"282"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [id, show]",{"range":"283","text":"284"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [prr, show2]",{"range":"285","text":"286"},{"range":"287","text":"284"},"Add dependencies array: [d]",{"range":"288","